Feature: Create a draft claim

  The employee who calls creates a DRAFT claim at version 1 for themselves; the domain assigns the id,
  and the total is the sum of the line amounts, in cents.

  Scenario: An employee creates a draft
    When I run "create_draft" with:
      | caller.role | caller.employee_id | actor_id | employee_id | manager_id | purpose              | currency | lines                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 | receipts_in_use |
      | employee    | emp-1              | emp-1    | emp-1       | mgr-1      | Client visit in Bern | EUR      | [{"category": "TRAVEL", "expense_date": "2026-11-02", "description": "Train to Bern", "amount": 12000, "receipt": {"sha256": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa", "media_type": "application/pdf", "size_bytes": 52000}}, {"category": "MEALS", "expense_date": "2026-11-03", "description": "Lunch", "amount": 2000}] | []              |
    Then the output is "claim":
      | claim_id       | state | total | currency | version | employee_id | manager_id |
      | CLM-0000000001 | DRAFT | 14000 | EUR      | 1       | emp-1       | mgr-1      |

  Scenario: A claim of a mileage line has a distance and no receipt
    When I run "create_draft" with:
      | caller.role | caller.employee_id | actor_id | employee_id | manager_id | purpose              | currency | lines                                                                                                                       | receipts_in_use |
      | employee    | emp-1              | emp-1    | emp-1       | mgr-1      | Client visit in Bern | EUR      | [{"category": "MILEAGE", "expense_date": "2026-11-02", "description": "Drive to Basel", "amount": 5600, "distance_km": 80}] | []              |
    Then the output is "claim":
      | total |
      | 5600  |

  Scenario: An employee may not create a claim for another employee
    When I run "create_draft" with:
      | caller.role | caller.employee_id | actor_id | employee_id | manager_id | purpose              | currency | lines                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 | receipts_in_use |
      | employee    | emp-2              | emp-2    | emp-1       | mgr-1      | Client visit in Bern | EUR      | [{"category": "TRAVEL", "expense_date": "2026-11-02", "description": "Train to Bern", "amount": 12000, "receipt": {"sha256": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa", "media_type": "application/pdf", "size_bytes": 52000}}, {"category": "MEALS", "expense_date": "2026-11-03", "description": "Lunch", "amount": 2000}] | []              |
    Then the output is "forbidden":
      | role     | actor_id |
      | employee | emp-2    |

  Scenario: The clock may not create a claim
    When I run "create_draft" with:
      | caller.role | actor_id | employee_id | manager_id | purpose              | currency | lines                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 | receipts_in_use |
      | clock       | emp-1    | emp-1       | mgr-1      | Client visit in Bern | EUR      | [{"category": "TRAVEL", "expense_date": "2026-11-02", "description": "Train to Bern", "amount": 12000, "receipt": {"sha256": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa", "media_type": "application/pdf", "size_bytes": 52000}}, {"category": "MEALS", "expense_date": "2026-11-03", "description": "Lunch", "amount": 2000}] | []              |
    Then the output is "forbidden":
      | role  | actor_id |
      | clock | emp-1    |

